Corrective fix: No changes required. The path is operating normally now. If the issue recurs, please capture the exact time and run a traceroute/mtr from 10.5.0.1 to a 172.16.30.x host during the incident so we can correlate with routing/adjacency logs and pinpoint a transient fault. We will continue to monitor. 
